{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43122","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48661","text":"--- name: review description: Use before high-stakes actions, after learning phases, after outcome failures, or when the user asks \"do we know enough?\", \"should we proceed?\", \"review coverage\", \"check readiness\", \"coverage check\". Epistemic self-modeling — decides act/learn/escalate. Routes through "},{"id":"spn-48662","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-48663","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-48664","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-48665","text":" machines. argument-hint: <goal_id> ---"}]},{"id":"blk-43123","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48666","text":"Coverage and Review"}]},{"id":"blk-43124","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48667","text":"Evaluate whether you know enough to act on a goal, or need to learn more."}]},{"id":"blk-43125","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48668","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-43126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48669","text":"Goal to review: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-43127","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48670","text":"Review Coverage"}]},{"id":"blk-43128","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"review_goal\",\n  goal_id: \"<id>\",\n  signal: {\n    \"retrieved_nodes\": [{\"node_id\": \"abc\", \"confidence\": 0.8, \"similarity\": 0.85}],\n    \"outcomes\": [{\"action_id\": \"fix-auth\", \"status\": \"success\", \"confidence\": 0.9}],\n    \"contradictions\": 0,\n    \"knowledge_gaps\": [\"How does the rate limiter interact with auth?\"],\n    \"supporting_evidence_count\": 5,\n    \"coverage_estimate\": 0.7\n  },\n  apply_decision: true\n)"},{"id":"blk-43129","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48671","marks":["bold"],"text":"Returns:"},{"id":"spn-48672","text":" "},{"id":"spn-48673","marks":["code"],"text":"decision"},{"id":"spn-48674","text":" (act/learn/escalate), "},{"id":"spn-48675","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage_score"},{"id":"spn-48676","text":", "},{"id":"spn-48677","marks":["code"],"text":"uncertainty_score"},{"id":"spn-48678","text":", "},{"id":"spn-48679","marks":["code"],"text":"risk_score"},{"id":"spn-48680","text":", "},{"id":"spn-48681","marks":["code"],"text":"rationale"},{"id":"spn-48682","text":", "},{"id":"spn-48683","marks":["code"],"text":"applied_review"},{"id":"spn-48684","text":", "},{"id":"spn-48685","marks":["code"],"text":"transition"},{"id":"spn-48686","text":" (if apply_decision was true), "},{"id":"spn-48687","marks":["code"],"text":"evaluation"},{"id":"spn-48688","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43130","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48689","text":"Decision Policy"}]},{"id":"blk-43131","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48690","marks":["bold"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-48691","text":" — coverage adequate, proceed with execution"}]}],"id":"blk-43132","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43135","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48692","marks":["bold"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-48693","text":" — gaps exist, gather more info, then re-review"}]}],"id":"blk-43134","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43137","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48694","marks":["bold"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-48695","text":" — critically low coverage or high risk, mark blocked, get external help"}]}],"id":"blk-43136","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43138","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48696","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-48697","marks":["code"],"text":"apply_decision: true"},{"id":"spn-48698","text":", the goal auto-transitions: act -> active, learn -> proposed, escalate -> blocked."}]},{"id":"blk-43139","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48699","text":"Tuning Options"}]},{"id":"blk-43140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48700","text":"Pass "},{"id":"spn-48701","marks":["code"],"text":"options"},{"id":"spn-48702","text":" to customize evaluation thresholds:"}]},{"id":"blk-43141","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"review_goal\",\n  goal_id: \"<id>\",\n  signal: { ... },\n  options: {\n    \"top_k\": 10,\n    \"min_context_nodes\": 3,\n    \"freshness_half_life_hours\": 48,\n    \"graph_support_target\": 0.6,\n    \"weights\": {\"coverage\": 0.4, \"confidence\": 0.3, \"freshness\": 0.2, \"support\": 0.1},\n    \"thresholds\": {\"act\": 0.7, \"learn\": 0.4}\n  }\n)"},{"id":"blk-43142","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43144","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48703","marks":["code"],"text":"top_k"},{"id":"spn-48704","text":" — how many top nodes to consider for scoring"}]}],"id":"blk-43143","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43146","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48705","marks":["code"],"text":"min_context_nodes"},{"id":"spn-48706","text":" — minimum linked nodes needed for adequate coverage"}]}],"id":"blk-43145","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43148","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48707","marks":["code"],"text":"freshness_half_life_hours"},{"id":"spn-48708","text":" — decay rate for old evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-43147","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43150","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48709","marks":["code"],"text":"graph_support_target"},{"id":"spn-48710","text":" — target ratio of supporting edges"}]}],"id":"blk-43149","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48711","marks":["code"],"text":"weights"},{"id":"spn-48712","text":" — custom scoring dimension weights"}]}],"id":"blk-43151","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48713","marks":["code"],"text":"thresholds"},{"id":"spn-48714","text":" — custom decision boundaries (above act threshold = act, below learn threshold = escalate)"}]}],"id":"blk-43153","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43155","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48715","text":"Building Honest Signals"}]},{"id":"blk-43156","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48716","text":"Build the "},{"id":"spn-48717","marks":["code"],"text":"signal"},{"id":"spn-48718","text":" from REAL retrieval data — never fabricate:"}]},{"id":"blk-43157","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48719","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48720","marks":["bold"],"text":"Always retrieve first"},{"id":"spn-48721","text":" — run "},{"id":"spn-48722","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48723","text":" before building the signal 2. "},{"id":"spn-48724","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieved_nodes"},{"id":"spn-48725","text":" — from actual results (include node_id, confidence, similarity) 3. "},{"id":"spn-48726","marks":["code"],"text":"outcomes"},{"id":"spn-48727","text":" — from actual "},{"id":"spn-48728","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48729","text":" calls 4. "},{"id":"spn-48730","marks":["code"],"text":"contradictions"},{"id":"spn-48731","text":" — count "},{"id":"spn-48732","marks":["code"],"text":"contradicts"},{"id":"spn-48733","text":" edges found during inspection 5. "},{"id":"spn-48734","marks":["code"],"text":"knowledge_gaps"},{"id":"spn-48735","text":" — questions the graph couldn't answer 6. "},{"id":"spn-48736","marks":["code"],"text":"supporting_evidence_count"},{"id":"spn-48737","text":" — number of "},{"id":"spn-48738","marks":["code"],"text":"supports"},{"id":"spn-48739","text":" edges found 7. "},{"id":"spn-48740","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage_estimate"},{"id":"spn-48741","text":" — your honest assessment (0.0-1.0)"}]},{"id":"blk-43158","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48742","text":"Standalone Coverage Query (No Goal Required)"}]},{"id":"blk-43159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48743","text":"For quick coverage assessment without a goal:"}]},{"id":"blk-43160","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\", query: \"auth middleware token validation\", limit: 10, expansion_hops: 1)"},{"id":"blk-43161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48744","text":"Returns coverage score, decision (act/learn/escalate), relevant nodes, and confidence stats. Use this when you want a fast coverage check without creating or linking to a goal."}]},{"id":"blk-43162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48745","marks":["bold"],"text":"`retrieve(action: \"coverage\")` vs `route(action: \"review_goal\")`:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43164","spans":[{"id":"spn-48746","text":""}]},{"id":"blk-43165","spans":[{"id":"spn-48747","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\")"}]},{"id":"blk-43166","spans":[{"id":"spn-48748","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\")"}]}],"id":"blk-43163","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43167","spans":[{"id":"spn-48749","marks":["bold"],"text":"Requires goal"}]},{"id":"blk-43168","spans":[{"id":"spn-48750","text":"No"}]},{"id":"blk-43169","spans":[{"id":"spn-48751","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43170","spans":[{"id":"spn-48752","marks":["bold"],"text":"Requires signal"}]},{"id":"blk-43171","spans":[{"id":"spn-48753","text":"No (auto-retrieves)"}]},{"id":"blk-43172","spans":[{"id":"spn-48754","text":"Yes (you build the signal)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43173","spans":[{"id":"spn-48755","marks":["bold"],"text":"State transitions"}]},{"id":"blk-43174","spans":[{"id":"spn-48756","text":"None"}]},{"id":"blk-43175","spans":[{"id":"spn-48757","text":"Optional (apply_decision)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43176","spans":[{"id":"spn-48758","marks":["bold"],"text":"Use when"}]},{"id":"blk-43177","spans":[{"id":"spn-48759","text":"Quick pre-action check"}]},{"id":"blk-43178","spans":[{"id":"spn-48760","text":"Formal goal-driven review"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-43179","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48761","text":"Workflow Patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-43180","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48762","text":"Pre-action gate"}]},{"id":"blk-43181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48763","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-48764","text":" -> build signal -> "},{"id":"spn-48765","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\")"},{"id":"spn-48766","text":" -> if "},{"id":"spn-48767","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-48768","text":", proceed; if "},{"id":"spn-48769","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-48770","text":", gather more; if "},{"id":"spn-48771","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-48772","text":", block."}]},{"id":"blk-43182","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48773","text":"Iterative review loop"}]},{"id":"blk-43183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48774","text":"After a "},{"id":"spn-48775","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-48776","text":" decision: retrieve more -> store findings -> re-review -> eventually reach "},{"id":"spn-48777","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-48778","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-48779","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-48780","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43184","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48781","text":"Post-failure review"}]},{"id":"blk-43185","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48782","text":"After "},{"id":"spn-48783","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"failure\")"},{"id":"spn-48784","text":": re-review the goal to reassess coverage with the new negative signal."}]},{"id":"blk-43186","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48785","text":"High-stakes review (strict thresholds)"}]},{"id":"blk-43187","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", goal_id: \"<id>\", signal: { ... }, options: {\"thresholds\": {\"act\": 0.85, \"learn\": 0.5}})"},{"id":"blk-43188","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48786","text":"Anti-patterns to avoid"}]},{"id":"blk-43189","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43191","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48787","text":"Signal fabrication — building signals from made-up data instead of real retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-43190","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48788","text":"Review theater — calling review_goal but ignoring the act/learn/escalate decision"}]}],"id":"blk-43192","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48789","text":"Skipping review before high-stakes actions"}]}],"id":"blk-43194","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierarrrw3qgll5mphdpqonzqppgdrq3jblf4gcjwvsruyb5cchh6dxcq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}